      84.62,
      613.09,
      529.41,
      714.83
    ],
    "text": "The Petitioner, even though, has claimed that the decisions of the 1st and 2nd Respondents are mala fide, she has not specifically pleaded that these officials have acted mala fide or for reasons of specific instances on which they have acted in the said manner. A mere statement that these government officials have acted mala fide will not be sufficient to challenge the decisions of these government officials. The 1st and 2nd Respondents, before taking the aforesaid decisions, have",
